      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think you misunderstand what public or private means in this context. This refers to if strangers can or cannot search up a group. You might wanna upvote the posts about Group+ Instances that let outsiders join. That sounds more like what you seem to be wanting.\n\nWhat you're describing though sounds like it'd just defeat the whole point of having the new instance type. Yeah it's weird cause it's so drastically different, but how it is gives it it's strengths.\n\nI won't pick at your idea any more than I have. Cause I do get and relate with wanting to better allow others in one moment, and keep the door shut the next.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
